 "text": "Merrow Line\n\nButtons\n\nYOUR SAILING IS FORTY MINUTES LATE.\n\nMove me to the next sailing with the same cabin, at no extra charge, and send me the new times (https://merrow.example/rebook)\n\nKeep my booking and wait (https://merrow.example/keep)\n\nWould a voucher for the café help?\n\nYes (https://merrow.example/voucher/yes)\n\nNo thanks (https://merrow.example/voucher/no)\n\nAt the end, centred on phones (https://merrow.example/harbour-office)",
